DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:Fall Pumpkin Patch at Green Meadows Farm
DESCRIPTION:Our goal at Green Meadows Petting Farm is to educate children of all ages about farm animals while providing a day of fun for everyone. Come out to the farm and get hands-on and up close with our friendly farm animals! Experiences include: Over 150+ animals Feeding the Animals (we provide the feed for FREE) Pig Races Hayrides Corn Crib Play Silo Large Play Area FREE Pumpkin from our Pumpkin Patch (October Daytime hours only\, 10am-4:30pm last admission 3pm) Our farm is ideal for: School field trips Day Care Centers and Preschools Company Parties Religious Gatherings Home Schools Scouts Birthday Parties for young and old Families and family gatherings Anyone who loves animals and the outdoors! Please check website before your visit for information\, hours of operation and weather closures. *Always closed Mondays & Tuesdays No pets or service animals please. Visit our website for additional information.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/fall-pumpkin-patch-at-green-meadows-farm/17328/
END:VEVENT
