BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventthefloralaffair26012-20261001@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:The Floral Affair
DESCRIPTION:Join us on October 1st from 6–9 PM for an elegant\, floral‑inspired evening designed to celebrate creativity\, community\, and boutique hospitality. The Floral Affair brings together elevated design\, curated ambiance\, and a welcoming space for guests to enjoy a beautifully crafted experience in the heart of downtown Frederick. We will make a beautiful centerpiece for you to take home and enjoy! Tickets include a delightful grazing table\, floral supplies\, fresh flowers and professional instruction. This event features signature floral artistry by The Frederick Floral Bar\, immersive photo‑ready moments\, and a warm\, intentional atmosphere perfect for connection and inspiration! Drinks available for purchase. Reserve your spot and experience an unforgettable night!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/the-floral-affair/26012/
END:VEVENT
