UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjumbospumpkinpatchfallfestival11483-20261003@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261003
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261004
SUMMARY:Jumbo's Pumpkin Patch Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season with a full day of festive fun for all ages at Jumbo’s Pumpkin Patch! From classic farm adventures to fall-themed attractions\, our Fall Fun Festival is the perfect weekend outing for families\, friends\, and pumpkin lovers. What’s Included with Admission: Your ticket includes unlimited access to a variety of seasonal attractions: Hayrides through the farm 30+ acre u-pick pumpkin patch (pumpkins sold by the pound) Corn maze (14 acres) Petting zoo Jumping pillow Giant slides Mini mazes for younger guests Playgrounds and yard games General Store with fall shopping and décor​ Optional Add-Ons: (Available for Purchase Onsite - Saturday and Sunday Only) Enhance your day with these fun extras: Pony Rides – $7 Face Painting – $4 Sandy Candy (Edible Sand Art) – $4 Corn Cannon – $5 (3 shots) ​ Food & Drinks: Come hungry! A variety of food\, snacks\, and beverages are available for purchase\, including selections from Liquidity Ale Works of Mt. Airy. Tickets available online or at the gate.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jumbos-pumpkin-patch-fall-festival/11483/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
