UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventguidedexhibittours25817-20261009@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
SUMMARY:Guided Exhibit Tours
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Museum of Frederick County History through a guided tour. Join the staff and volunteers who curated our 2026 exhibits as they explore our various galleries. Each tour is a unique experience based on the interests of the group and what special things staff wants to highlight that week. Descriptions of each week's tour can be found on the Heritage Frederick website\, which includes accessibility notes. Tours are included with admission!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/guided-exhibit-tours/25817/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventjamiekayefirstfridays25206-20261009@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261009
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261010
SUMMARY:Jamie Kaye First Fridays
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Jamie Kaye’s First Fridays at Sandbox! Jamie is an incredibly talented local sensation who has played at venues all over Frederick and the surrounding area. She’ll be at Sandbox playing her high energy\, all star set including current and classic hits\, sprinkled in originals\, AND a little birdie told us she takes song requests. Jamie ALWAYS brings a fun time - you won’t want to miss it!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/jamie-kaye-first-fridays/25206/
END:VEVENT
