BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgevent2026exhibitsatmuseumoffrederickcountyhistory24908-20261211@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:2026 Exhibits at Museum of Frederick County History
DESCRIPTION:Take a deep dive into various topics that have defined Frederick's history\, as we celebrate America's 250th anniversary and our County's role in the Revolution. Featuring brand new exhibits: Cultivating Independence: Frederick in the Revolution Witnessing Revolution All Saints Street: Avenue to the History of Frederick and Its African American Community Growing Gold: A History of Frederick’s Goldfish Industry And returning favorites: Etchison Connections Timeless Toys 24 E Church Street Decorative Arts See our all new and renovated exhibits\, March 7\,2026 through December 12\, 2026. Buy tickets here.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/2026-exhibits-at-museum-of-frederick-county-history/24908/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventfrederickcityparks26rec3asenioryoga24650-20261211@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:Frederick City Parks & Rec: Senior Yoga
DESCRIPTION:A yoga class focused on stretching the body. Slow movements and long holds are emphasized in this class. Modifications are provided and welcome during your practice. All ages are welcome.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/frederick-city-parks-%26-rec%3a-senior-yoga/24650/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventguidedexhibittours25817-20261211@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20260930T163127Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261211
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261212
SUMMARY:Guided Exhibit Tours
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Museum of Frederick County History through a guided tour. Join the staff and volunteers who curated our 2026 exhibits as they explore our various galleries. Each tour is a unique experience based on the interests of the group and what special things staff wants to highlight that week. Descriptions of each week's tour can be found on the Heritage Frederick website\, which includes accessibility notes. Tours are included with admission!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/guided-exhibit-tours/25817/
END:VEVENT
